  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the bustling kitchen of Claude Monet, French pastry chef Louis is overwhelmed by an enormous banquet order. Desperate for assistance, he appeals to Chef Viktor Barinov, who decides that novice cook Max will be his helper for the day. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Шеф, у меня большие проблемы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что опять случилось на кухне?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Мне срочно нужен хороший помощник.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Почему ты не работаешь один?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Я один сегодня не справлюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "У тебя слишком много работы?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Пришёл очень большой заказ на банкет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что именно нужно приготовить?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Свежие круассаны и большой торт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Макс будет работать с тобой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Но он ничего не умеет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Он будет чистить и резать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Ладно, пусть моет посуду.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's examine Louis and Chef Barinov's kitchen exchange line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Шеф, у меня большие проблемы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, I have big problems.' Overwhelmed at the pastry station, Louis runs to the chef and says he is in big trouble.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что опять случилось на кухне?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened in the kitchen again?' Barinov sighs and asks what crisis has hit his kitchen this time.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Мне срочно нужен хороший помощник.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I urgently need a good assistant.' Louis insists that he urgently needs a capable assistant today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Почему ты не работаешь один?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why are you not working alone?' Viktor asks why the pastry chef cannot handle his section on his own as usual.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Я один сегодня не справлюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I alone will not manage today.' Louis explains that there is simply too much baking for one person today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "У тебя слишком много работы?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have too much work?' Barinov asks if the workload has really piled up that high.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Пришёл очень большой заказ на банкет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A very big banquet order arrived.' Louis points to a massive banquet order that just came in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что именно нужно приготовить?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What exactly needs to be prepared?' Viktor asks what items the banquet menu requires from the pastry station.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Свежие круассаны и большой торт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fresh croissants and a big cake.' Louis lists fresh croissants along with an enormous celebration cake.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Макс будет работать с тобой.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Max will work with you.' To get Louis off his back, Barinov assigns rookie cook Max to help him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Но он ничего не умеет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But he does not know how to do anything.' Louis protests that Max has no idea how to bake fine French pastries.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Он будет чистить и резать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He will peel and cut.' Viktor shrugs and says Max can peel fruit and chop ingredients.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Ладно, пусть моет посуду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fine, let him wash the dishes.' Giving in, Louis decides he will at least put Max on dishwashing duty. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
