    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With a skeptical Louis reluctantly accepting Max's assistance, the kitchen prepares to tackle the demanding banquet pastry order under Chef Barinov's watchful eye. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'banquet' and 'big' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
